wild_encounter.c: the page's hacks for testing (platform/include/hacks.h).

Wild Pokémon in grass and water never come (StandardWildEncounter), or come on
every step (WildEncounterCheck's odds and the 60% chance on a new kind of
tile, AllowWildCheckOnNewMetatile). With the hack off both roll as the game
does.

